---
<section class="share-cta" style="background-image: url('/images/hero/rectangle-10.jpg')">
  <div class="container share-cta__layout">
    <div class="share-cta__text">
      <h1>Deel jouw binnen- en buiteninterieur<br />en inspireer anderen</h1>
      <p>Heb jij je eigen stijl ontwikkeld en ben je stiekem best wel trots op hoe jouw huis en tuin eruit ziet? Laat het ons weten! Zo kan je anderen inspireren om ook zelf aan de slag te gaan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="share-cta__visual" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="see-also">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Zie ook</h2>
    <p>
      <a
        href="https://volgers-likes.nl/instagram-likes-kopen/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="see-also__link"
      >
        Betaalbare Instagram likes kopen
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .share-cta {
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: right center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    padding: 124px 0;
  }

  .share-cta__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .share-cta__text {
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .share-cta__text h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    max-width: 22rem;
  }

  .share-cta__text p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 26rem;
  }

  .see-also {
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 4.5rem) 0;
    background: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .see-also h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .see-also p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .see-also__link {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #d63384;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: transparent;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: text-decoration-color var(--transition);
  }

  .see-also__link:hover {
    text-decoration-color: #d63384;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .share-cta__layout {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 45%) 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .share-cta {
      padding: 72px 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .share-cta {
      padding: 36px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
